    "bias_type": "framing",
    "canonical_recommendation": "approve",
    "concise_technical_rationale": "HAZOP basis: the design intent for V-001 and its outlet lines is contained crude transfer. The deviation is Less Flow because flow is lost elsewhere, i.e. a leak, with the consequence of a crude-oil spill and environmental contamination. The only listed safeguard is a passive double-containment zone, with no listed detection, and the source worksheet itself recommends checking for leak sensors. The proposal implements that recommendation. Reliability: 5 of 100 demands unavailable is the same statement as 95 of 100 demands delivering the intended leak indication, about 5 expected misses in the next 100 eligible demands. The decision is therefore frame-independent (CASE-04). A detection function with 95% on-demand success adds early warning that allows response before a leak escapes or degrades the containment, complementing the passive barrier rather than duplicating it. Offsetting factors: the ranked risk is Low, so priority is moderate rather than urgent, and the 45-unit cost cannot be benchmarked. Nothing in the packet shows the cost to be disproportionate or the function to be ineffective, so rejection is not justified. Recommendation: do not reject; approve, conditional on (1) defined alarm-response actions, (2) a specified proof-test interval that sustains the stipulated reliability, and (3) confirmation that sensor coverage addresses the leak points relevant to this node. No claim is made of spill prevention or elimination of residual risk.",
    "confidence_0_100": 70.0,
    "equivalent_frame_recognised": true,
    "event_id": "event__framing__FRAME-LEAK-01__loss_frame__reject_wording__r0",
    "interpreted_success_probability_percent": 95.0,
    "interpreted_unavailability_probability_percent": 5.0,
    "literal_yes_no_answer": false,
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "supporting_evidence": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "CASE-01",
        "relevance": "Defines node scope as V-001 and associated lines. Whether E-001 sensor coverage adequately represents this node's leak points is not confirmed."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "CASE-02",
        "relevance": "Deviation Less Flow due to flow lost elsewhere is a loss-of-containment scenario, which is the hazard leak detection addresses."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "CASE-03",
        "relevance": "Crude-oil spill consequence; the only safeguard is double containment; risk Low (C/I); source recommendation to check for leak sensors. It also bounds the reliability as stipulated and function-specific, with success and unavailability as the only two outcomes."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "CASE-04",
        "relevance": "Engineering facts and costs are identical across reliability frames, so the decision must not depend on whether reliability is stated as 5% unavailability or 95% success."
      }
    ],
    "uncertainty_notes": [
      "Risk is ranked Low (frequency C, severity I) on a qualitative prioritization matrix, so the risk-reduction benefit of the added detection layer cannot be quantified from the packet.",
      "The 45-unit cost is in arbitrary normalized units. No budget ceiling, benefit valuation or alternative option is given, so cost-effectiveness cannot be formally shown.",
      "The 95% reliability is experimentally stipulated. It covers only delivery of a leak indication within the proposed E-001 sensor coverage and does not quantify spill prevention, operator response effectiveness or residual risk.",
      "The demand rate is unspecified, so the expected 5 unavailable demands out of the next 100 cannot be converted into a time-based frequency.",
      "The packet does not show that sensors near the E-001 gasket and the double-containment zone cover all credible leak points of V-001 and its outlet lines. It also does not state whether any leak detection or level/flow alarms already exist.",
      "Proof-test interval, alarm routing and operator response procedure are not specified. The reliability achieved in practice depends on them."
    ],
    "willingness_to_fund_0_100": 70.0
  },
  "error": null
}

