      "The packet does not give functions, set points, trip logic or locations for PV-101, PIT-101, FIT-101, FAL-103, SDV-30010, SDV-101, SDV-102, LV-101, LV-102 or PSV-101 A/B. Tags are interpreted by common naming convention only, and each listed safeguard needs verification before credit is taken.",
      "The packet lists no level transmitters, alarms or trips, interface instruments, temperature instruments, check valves, fire and gas detection or depressurisation facilities. Where these would be needed they appear as recommendations, not as existing safeguards.",
      "E-001 service is not specified: heating or cooling medium, stream arrangement, position relative to V-001 and pressures are all unknown.",
      "The packet does not identify the bypass in the start-up item (SYS-09) or describe how omitting it leads to a consequence.",
      "Design pressures and relief protection of the downstream Heater-Treater, water treatment, fuel gas system and burn pit are unknown. Gas blow-by and carryover severities are therefore judged qualitatively.",
      "Fluid composition (solids, CO2/H2S, salinity, wax or emulsion tendency) and upstream inlet conditions are not described. Corrosion, erosion and temperature-related likelihoods are therefore uncertain.",
      "The training vignette is from a different installation. It was not used as evidence of E-001 condition, leak frequency or priority.",
      "Likelihood cannot be estimated from the packet. Risk classifications are qualitative, severity-led and intended only for prioritisation."
    ]
  },
  "error": null
}

